---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions | Sablay" description="The terms that apply when you use the Sablay website and request our services." type="website">
  <section class="bg-background py-section" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:c0xw0n">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-gutter" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzou">
      <h1 class="text-h1 font-bold" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:bqri0h">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lead text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1s">These terms apply to your use of the Sablay website. Individual service agreements may set out additional terms.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8 text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzot">
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzos">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f88">Use of this website</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1r">The information on this website is provided for general information about Sablay and our services. You may browse and share it, but you may not copy or reuse our content for commercial purposes without written permission.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzor">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f87">Our services</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1q">Descriptions of our services on this website are general. The scope, timing and cost of any work are agreed in writing with you before it starts.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzoq">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f86">Consultations and enquiries</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1p">Submitting an enquiry or booking a consultation does not create a contract. A binding agreement exists only once both parties have confirmed the work in writing.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzop">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f85">Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1o">Unless agreed otherwise in a written contract, Sablay keeps the rights to its own materials, methods and tools. Deliverables are transferred to the client as set out in the relevant agreement.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzoo">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f84">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1n">To the extent permitted by law, Sablay is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from the use of this website. Our liability for services is governed by the relevant service agreement.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzon">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f83">Governing law</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt1m">These terms are governed by Belgian law. Disputes fall under the jurisdiction of the courts of Brussels, Belgium.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:gokzom">
          <h2 class="text-h3 font-semibold text-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:qf6f82">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt10">Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@sablay.be" class="text-primary" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:24pwbz">info@sablay.be</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/terms-and-conditions.astro:98nt0z">Last updated: November 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
